1
00:00:50,830 --> 00:00:51,544
Rinkham,

2
00:00:53,250 --> 00:00:54,252
where on earth are you?

3
00:01:06,660 --> 00:01:07,735
You're awake, Lady?

4
00:01:12,530 --> 00:01:16,098
Luang Wisanu will surely give up everything to get his daughter back.

5
00:02:06,090 --> 00:02:06,726
Rinkham.

6
00:02:06,720 --> 00:02:07,452
Kaew.

7
00:02:08,300 --> 00:02:09,163
I'm sorry.

8
00:02:09,390 --> 00:02:10,886
I'm so sorry I got here too late.

9
00:02:12,473 --> 00:02:14,470
I'm sorry for leaving you alone.

10
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:16,178
It's not your fault.

11
00:02:16,590 --> 00:02:18,867
It's my fault for being stubborn. I'm sorry.

12
00:02:20,180 --> 00:02:21,378
Don't say that.

13
00:02:22,980 --> 00:02:24,529
I'm getting you out of here.

14
00:02:30,340 --> 00:02:31,329
Kaew, look out!

15
00:02:32,660 --> 00:02:33,489
Kaew!

16
00:02:34,490 --> 00:02:35,335
Kaew!

17
00:02:38,380 --> 00:02:39,212
Kaew!

18
00:02:40,140 --> 00:02:41,021
Kaew!

19
00:02:56,184 --> 00:02:57,020
Are you awake?

20
00:02:58,920 --> 00:03:01,243
Rinkham, how are you?

21
00:03:02,180 --> 00:03:03,446
I am fine.

22
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:11,353
You're awake, huh?

23
00:03:16,490 --> 00:03:21,206
A bodyguard like this, who could he possibly protect, right?

24
00:03:21,230 --> 00:03:22,393
Don't get involved with her.

25
00:03:25,140 --> 00:03:28,166
In that state, you still dare to order us around?

26
00:03:32,080 --> 00:03:35,120
Still better than you lot, ganging up like dogs.

27
00:03:37,370 --> 00:03:38,326
You've got a big mouth.

28
00:03:38,610 --> 00:03:40,947
You're about to learn how you should really speak.

29
00:03:50,530 --> 00:03:54,769
Bullying someone weaker like this shows you have no honor.

30
00:03:57,710 --> 00:03:58,443
Honor?

31
00:04:00,160 --> 00:04:01,889
Honor doesn't make me full.

32
00:04:04,540 --> 00:04:09,433
But dishonorable people like you usually end up miserable.

33
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:11,372
You talk too much.

34
00:05:37,030 --> 00:05:37,901
Rinkham, go!

35
00:05:55,335 --> 00:05:56,449
Stay right here.

36
00:05:59,440 --> 00:06:00,406
Wait here first.

37
00:06:01,890 --> 00:06:02,578
I'll go deal with them.

38
00:06:02,590 --> 00:06:03,483
No.

39
00:06:05,620 --> 00:06:07,267
Let me protect you for once.

40
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:10,824
But it's dangerous.

41
00:06:10,849 --> 00:06:11,581
Listen to me.

42
00:06:12,350 --> 00:06:13,833
I will handle this myself.

43
00:06:32,910 --> 00:06:34,744
Hey! What the heck?

44
00:06:35,430 --> 00:06:36,516
A woman?

45
00:06:38,210 --> 00:06:39,987
What kind of crazy bodyguard is a woman?

46
00:06:44,060 --> 00:06:46,676
But that’s fine, makes it easier to handle.

47
00:07:59,690 --> 00:08:01,181
We should be safe here for now.

48
00:08:02,030 --> 00:08:03,132
You should rest.

49
00:08:11,650 --> 00:08:13,015
Can I ask you something?

50
00:08:15,500 --> 00:08:16,880
What is the truth?

51
00:08:18,620 --> 00:08:24,123
Why... Why did you have to disguise yourself to join the military selection?

52
00:08:34,450 --> 00:08:39,236
My real name is Kaewket.

53
00:08:42,326 --> 00:08:43,526
My dad is sick.

54
00:08:46,460 --> 00:08:50,787
So I disguised myself to enlist,

55
00:08:51,870 --> 00:08:53,544
just to get the money to cure him.

56
00:08:58,080 --> 00:09:03,187
I never thought I would get this close to you.

57
00:09:06,670 --> 00:09:08,590
Or feel this way about you.

58
00:09:21,686 --> 00:09:22,732
I'm sorry.

59
00:09:24,400 --> 00:09:27,113
I'm sorry that everything started with a lie.

60
00:09:31,340 --> 00:09:33,458
I shouldn't have let it come to this.

61
00:09:40,970 --> 00:09:42,596
I will go tell your dad.

62
00:09:45,470 --> 00:09:50,018
And after this, we might never see each other again.
